$ invoice-api

  invoice-api runs a small HTTP service for listing and retrieving invoices.

Usage:

  $ pip install --editable .
  $ invoice-api --port 8000
  $ curl -H 'Authorization: Bearer demo-alice-token' \
      http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/invoices
  $ curl -H 'Authorization: Bearer demo-alice-token' \
      http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/invoices/1001
